data: {"id": "1e7f76ae0b6b44aa-final", "run_id": "1e7f76ae0b6b44aa", "seq": 2080, "ts_ms": 1788803055149, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-wmjhr` | CrashLoopBackOff | 容器运行时的内存硬限制(64Mi)不足以支撑应用在执行HTTP请求时持续增长分配的内存(FAILURE_MODE=oom_growth)，导致Linux内核触发OOM Killer终止进程。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | BackOff restarting failed container app (x277 over 73m) | 证实容器处于反复崩溃重启的异常状态 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Reason: OOMKilled, Exit Code: 137 | 确认进程因内存超限被系统强制终止 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | container resource limit: 64Mi, request: 24Mi | 确认应用拥有极低的硬限制内存 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | container_memory_working_set_bytes: max=66236416.0, first=245760.0 (61 samples, trend_evaluable=true) | 观测内存实际使用从 245KB 持续攀升逼近并突破 64MB 阈值 |\n| 5 | Logging | Elasticsearch | Pattern: `memory allocation advanced` (8 occurrences, trace_ids: 30cc..., 5a3a...), allocated_mib: first=12.0, last=42.0 | 日志明确记录 HTTP 请求期间内存从 12MB 分配至 42MB 的行为，与指标增长趋势一致 |\n| 6 | Tracing | Deepflow/Tempo | Flow/Span: GET /work (response_code: 200, sample_count: 9), Tempo observed_mode: oom_growth | 追踪链路确认导致内存分配的业务入口及内存持续增长模式 |\n\n**证据关联说明：**\n证据 1 和 2 共同构成了“容器崩溃”的直接现象；证据 3 揭示了导致崩溃的资源边界条件（64Mi 限制）。证据 5（日志中的内存分配行为）与证据 4（内存使用指标的增长趋势）形成了闭环，证实了应用在处理请求时实际消耗远超限制；证据 6 则进一步通过链路追踪定位了具体的业务操作（GET /work），明确了故障触发路径。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n应用配置为内存持续增长模式(FAILURE_MODE=oom_growth)且在请求中分配内存 → 容器累积内存使用(最高66Mi)超过设定的64Mi硬限制 → Linux内核OOM Killer强制终止容器进程(Exit Code 137) → Kubernetes检测到进程崩溃并不断重启，导致CrashLoopBackOff\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因：** 容器 `aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-wmjhr` 的内存硬限制配置过低（64Mi），无法容纳应用在 HTTP 请求期间持续增长分配的内存。\n\n证据链（证据 3、4、5、6）明确显示，应用在处理请求（如 `allocated_mib` 从 12MB 增至 42MB）时的工作集内存持续扩张，并最终突破了 64Mi 的系统硬性上限，导致内核 OOM Killer 介入终止进程（证据 2）。该行为引发了 Kubernetes 的自动重启机制，从而造成了当前的 CrashLoopBackOff 状态（证据 1）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.4m\n├─ 问题定位: 22.9s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 109.3s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-wmjhr: 109.3s (Evidence 101.0s, RCA 8.2s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 10.9s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-wmjhr**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 143.226, "metrics": {"run_id": "1e7f76ae0b6b44aa", "mttr": {"value": "2.4m", "seconds": 143.23046112060547, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.8667, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3333333333333333, "weighted_score": 0.0667}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 143230.46112060547, "llm_calls": 11, "llm_duration_ms": 95608.01959037781, "tool_calls": 17, "executed_tool_calls": 17, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 17, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 161990.54408073425, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 47099.44462776184}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 22945.677280426025, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 109334.30242538452, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 10923.133850097656, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

